# Cursor Rules for Davon.Health Website Maintenance

## Pre-Commit Checklist
Before committing changes, ensure:

### Date Updates (Always Required)
- [ ] Update `dateModified` in `src/app/page.tsx` structured data
- [ ] Update `lastmod` in `public/sitemap.xml`
- [ ] Use current date in YYYY-MM-DD format

### Content Changes
- [ ] If adding FAQ questions, update `faqData` array in `src/app/page.tsx`
- [ ] If changing meta descriptions, update `src/app/layout.tsx`
- [ ] If adding images, optimize to WebP and add alt text
- [ ] If changing company info, update Organization schema

### SEO Validation
- [ ] Test structured data with Rich Results Test
- [ ] Validate sitemap.xml format
- [ ] Check robots.txt accessibility
- [ ] Verify llms.txt content accuracy

## Code Quality Rules

### TypeScript
- Use proper TypeScript types for all variables
- Avoid `any` type except when necessary
- Add JSDoc comments for complex functions

### React Components
- Use functional components with hooks
- Implement proper error boundaries
- Add loading states for async operations

### SEO Best Practices
- All images must have alt text
- Use semantic HTML elements
- Maintain proper heading hierarchy (H1→H2→H3)
- Keep URLs clean and descriptive

## File Organization
- Keep components in `/src/components/`
- Static assets in `/public/`
- Utility functions in `/src/lib/`
- Page components in `/src/app/`

## Performance Guidelines
- Optimize images before committing
- Avoid large bundle sizes
- Use lazy loading for below-fold content
- Minimize unused CSS/JS

## Deployment Reminders
- Update domain URLs before production deploy
- Test on multiple devices/browsers
- Validate all external links
- Check console for errors
